  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products: </p><p>Blaise is a performance coach, author, and founder of the Suplify performance system. Our mission is simple: help athletes build confidence, discipline, and a winning mindset both on and off the field. Our flagship book, <em>The Young Athlete’s Playbook</em>, gives young athletes a practical blueprint for improving performance, building mental toughness, and developing championship habits.</p><p>This is not just another sports book. It’s a system used by real coaches, athletes, and families to build stronger, more confident competitors.</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• What makes us different:</p><p>Most youth sports resources focus only on drills or workouts. Our system focuses on the <strong>complete athlete</strong>: mindset, discipline, preparation, and performance. The book is written by a coach who works directly with athletes and teams, making it highly practical and relatable.</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn:</p><p>Affiliates earn commission for every book sold through their custom link. This is a perfect fit for:<br>• Coaches<br>• Sports trainers<br>• Athletic programs<br>• Parenting influencers<br>• Fitness creators<br>• Youth sports organizations</p><p>With strong demand from parents and athletes looking for better guidance, affiliates have an easy product to promote.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us:</p><p>Affiliates can promote through:<br>• Instagram, TikTok, and YouTube<br>• Coaching communities<br>• Email newsletters<br>• Parent and athlete groups<br>• Sports training content</p><p>We provide affiliate links and resources to make promotion simple.</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• Other information:Our mission is bigger than selling books. We are building a movement focused on developing stronger athletes and stronger people through discipline, mindset, and preparation.</p></div></div>",
